# English-only (product / repo text)

Audience for this project **only speaks English**. Do **not** put German (or other non-English) into anything users or contributors see in the product.

## Must be English

- Web UI: labels, buttons, tabs, tooltips, `aria-label`, placeholders, status / progress / error strings
- In-app copy in `web/**` (HTML, JS, CSS content)
- README, docs, TODO items, comments that explain behavior to readers
- Commit messages and PR descriptions for this repo

## Examples

```html
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<span>Gemaxte ausblenden</span>

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<span>Hide maxed</span>
```

```js
// ❌ BAD
status.textContent = "Simuliere…";

// ✅ GOOD
status.textContent = "Running simulation…";
```

## Exceptions

- Chat with the repo owner may stay in their language.
- Proper names / game terms stay as in CIFI (Borge, Obsidian, Behlium, HBM, …).
- Do not translate identifiers, file paths, or API keys.

If you find leftover German in UI or docs while editing, fix it in the same change.
